    "summary" -> 
    "CyclicTagCompiler compiles finite cellular automata, automata networks, \
oblivious ring machines and n-ary cyclic tag systems to ordinary cyclic tag \
systems, and decodes the evolution of a cyclic tag system back to the \
evolution of the system it emulates. Cyclic tag systems are among the \
simplest universal systems, and are used in the proofs that the rule 110 \
cellular automaton and Wolfram's 2,3 Turing machine are universal.", 
